{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>&quot;Lover&quot; is a <i>Chinese dreamcore, psychological and survival horror game with multiple endings</i>. You play as a student who has returned from the &quot;<i>Lover Internet Addiction Treatment School</i>&quot;.</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527750/extras/LOGO\u65b0_00000222222_00000.png?t=1740698440\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> After enduring <strong>mental torment</strong>, you discover the truth about &quot;<strong>Lover</strong>&quot; and yourself on <strong>an ordinary day......</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527750/extras/\u5ba3\u4f201title_00681.png?t=1740698440\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">&quot;Lover&quot; was developed independently by a single person over six months. The initial concept was simply &quot;to create a horror experience about an internet addiction treatment school through visuals and gameplay mechanics,&quot;<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527750/extras/\u5ba3\u4f20GIF1.gif?t=1740698440\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>which gradually evolved with additional elements to become the current independent horror game &quot;Lover.&quot;</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Open this door,</strong> welcome home... or, welcome to school...... A dream? Or is it your own unfathomable mental illness?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527750/extras/7.png?t=1740698440\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple endings\u2014Multiple branches\u2014Path choices</strong> <strong>In &quot;Lover,&quot; players can achieve up to 3 <i>different &quot;special&quot;</i> endings, </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>gradually uncovering the truth through multiple narrative paths, or... falling into the vortex of other worlds......</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527750/extras/talk_ui_2_00000.png?t=1740698440\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Intense chase sequences, moderately challenging puzzles, and...</strong> <strong>A Sanity System\u2014</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527750/extras/2.png?t=1740698440\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome home...... And, are you the next one to come here, to explore the truth?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Ending:\u4e0d\u8fde\u7eed\u5b58\u5728\u7684\u6bcf\u4e00\u5929","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3527750/b03ce0f620ad1664e87590dc00b2c5e841da9087.jpg"},{"name":"Ending:\u771f\u76f8","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3527750/c36643b2801d817cf7c6e2c79013e94c386d46ea.jpg"},{"name":"Ending:\u540e\u5ba4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3527750/ec50956ed1b48963397ffe38239f4de53ca34fdc.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3527750?t=1740698440","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3527750?t=1740698440","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527750/86724c6c025b16d764fa89e50bfadc97dec3ba38/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740698440","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527750/86724c6c025b16d764fa89e50bfadc97dec3ba38/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740698440","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null}